---
import { Wifi, WifiOff } from "lucide-react";
---

<section id="connectivite" class="border-b border-solid border-surface-border bg-surface">
	<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-start gap-6 px-6 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
		<div class="max-w-lg">
			<h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-text-primary">
				La connexion coupe. La réception continue.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
				Pilote enregistre tout en local et synchronise dès que le réseau
				revient. Aucune vente perdue, aucune ressaisie.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-solid border-surface-border bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-text-secondary">
			<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
				<WifiOff className="h-3.5 w-3.5" strokeWidth={2} />
				Sans réseau
			</span>
			<span class="h-px w-4 bg-surface-border"></span>
			<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-bright">
				<Wifi className="h-3.5 w-3.5" strokeWidth={2} />
				Synchronisé
			</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
